        "St John Street · Manchester",
        "One barber.One chair.Your full hour.",
        "Chair and Blade is a private, appointment-only barbering studio tucked away on St John Street. No queue, no rush, no second chair — just precise cutting, straight razor finishing, and a conversation if you want one.",
        "AddressSt John Street, Manchester",
        "HoursTuesday – Saturday",
        "BookingBy appointment only",
        "ChairsOne. Always has been."
