      "text": [
        "Services & Prices",
        "Every cut, unhurried.",
        "Signature Cut",
        "Consultation, precision scissor or clipper cut, styling and finish. The core booking most regulars come back for.",
        "Skin Fade & Beard Sculpt",
        "A tight, blended skin fade paired with beard shaping, line-up and hot towel prep.",
        "Cut & Straight Razor Shave",
        "Full haircut followed by a traditional hot towel straight razor shave — the complete studio experience.",
        "Beard Trim & Line-Up",
        "Shape, trim and edge for beards already in good condition. A quick, sharp reset between full cuts.",
        "Grey Blending",
        "Subtle, natural tone-down for grey hair and beards — softened, never flat.",
        "Prices correct as of your booking date. Card and contactless only — the studio doesn't take cash.",
        "£38 · 60 min",
        "£48 · 75 min",
